sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor Associate as Store Associate
    participant POS as POS Client (React Native)
    participant GW as Apollo Gateway (GraphQL)
    participant ID as Identity Service
    participant Cart as Cart Service
    participant Cache as Inventory Cache (Redis)
    participant SAP as SAP ECC (Source of Truth)

    Note over Associate, SAP: Meridian Phase 1 In-Store Online-Cart Lookup Flow

    Associate->>POS: Scans customer loyalty QR code (~50ms)
    POS->>GW: POST /graphql (query: getCustomerCartByQR) (~15ms)
    
    rect rgb(240, 248, 260)
        note right of GW: Step 1: Resolve Identity & Token
        GW->>ID: Validate loyalty token & resolve customerId (~20ms, p95)
        ID-->>GW: Customer Profile & ID
    end

    rect rgb(245, 245, 220)
        note right of GW: Step 2: Retrieve Active Online Cart
        GW->>Cart: Fetch active cart & line items by customerId (~30ms, p95)
        Cart-->>GW: Cart items [SKU-A, SKU-B, SKU-C]
    end

    rect rgb(230, 245, 230)
        note right of GW: Step 3: Check Stock Availability (Cache-First)
        GW->>Cache: MGET stock[SKU-A, SKU-B, SKU-C] (~5ms, p95)
        Cache-->>GW: Stock Status: [SKU-A: Available, SKU-B: Available, SKU-C: MISS]
    end

    alt Cache Miss Detected for SKU-C
        note over GW, SAP: Fallback Path for Cache Miss
        GW->>SAP: Synchronous OData Read stock for SKU-C (~400ms, p95)
        SAP-->>GW: Stock Status: SKU-C Available (Slow Path)
    end

    GW-->>POS: Render online cart with live stock status (~15ms)
    POS-->>Associate: Display cart items & fulfillment options on screen (~50ms)

    Note over Associate, POS: Total Happy Path p95 ~135ms | With SAP Fallback p95 ~535ms (Well within 1500ms SLA)